### 회의록 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-notes?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 회의록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-notes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 회의록 작성
POST {{baseUrl}}/channels/{{channelId}}/meeting-notes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "주간 회의",
  "values": {}
}
